# Expected SHA-256 of src/ffmpeg/ffmpeg.exe.
#
# Empty means "unpinned" - fetch-ffmpeg.cmd will warn but continue, which is
# fine for development. A RELEASE build must have this filled in, so the exact
# binary shipped can be named in the GPL source offer and an unexpected upstream
# replacement is detected rather than silently used.
#
# To pin: run build\fetch-ffmpeg.cmd, then
#   certutil -hashfile src\ffmpeg\ffmpeg.exe SHA256
# and paste the hash below on its own line.
